# End-to-end suite configuration.
#
# Copy to `.env` when a run should use fixed locations instead of the
# throwaway temp directories the launch scripts create. Variables already
# exported by the shell (or by CI) take precedence over this file, and every
# key below is optional.

# Directory the extension writes its user-level Copilot hooks file into. The
# extension-host suite reads `pali.json` back from here.
# PALI_HOOKS_DIR=/tmp/pali-e2e/hooks

# File the extension installs the Pali Memory instructions into.
# PALI_INSTRUCTIONS_PATH=/tmp/pali-e2e/instructions/pali-memory.instructions.md

# Directory the extension installs the `pali-memory` skill into. The host
# suite's uninstall test deletes the installed copy, so this must not point at
# the developer's real `~/.copilot/skills`.
# PALI_SKILLS_DIR=/tmp/pali-e2e/skills

# Directory vscode-extension-tester keeps its VS Code build and user data in.
# Defaults to ./test-resources.
# PALI_E2E_STORAGE=/tmp/pali-e2e/storage
